ush":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/pulls/11640","html_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/pull/11640","diff_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/pull/11640.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/pull/11640.patch","merged_at":"2020-02-21T17:32:33Z"},"body":"When promoting a learner member we should not count already a voting\r\nmember, but take only into account the number of existing voting\r\nmembers and their current status (started, unstarted) when taking the\r\ndecision whether a learner member can be promoted.\r\n\r\nBefore this change, it was impossible to grow from a quorum N to a N+1\r\nthrough promoting a learning member.\r\n\r\nFixes: #11633\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nNote: it would be good to add tests to https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/blob/b64b36ae9f74fa26784a1589b668d8358578439d/etcdserver/server.go#L1490-L1520 and https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/blob/b64b36ae9f74fa26784a1589b668d8358578439d/etcdserver/server.go#L1522-L1543 as well, so we test other promotion traits. As far as I could see there are no tests at all regarding learning member promotion (or I couldn't find them).","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/11640/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/11640/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/comments/588319174","html_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/issues/11633#issuecomment-588319174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/11633","id":588319174,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU4ODMxOTE3NA==","user":{"login":"ereslibre","id":8706,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3MDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8706?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/use